Error [jet.ApplicationAuthorityDenied]: Application authority is undecided for `FS.Write`
 Why: This program writes files, and the default for a file with no package block has not allowed that yet.
 Fix: run `jet run --allow=FS.Write -` (or `-A`/`--allow-all` for every effect) to allow it for this run, or declare a leading `package: { name: "stdin", authority: { allow: [FS.Write] } }` block in the piped source; otherwise approve the exact operation once in an interactive terminal
 Denial: authority
 Scope chain: application default
